{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":20,"code":"PRO","name":"Proverbs","testament":"OT"},"chapter":14,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PRO 14:1"},"Every wise woman buildeth her house: but the foolish plucketh it down with her hands. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:1"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PRO 14:2"},"He that walketh in his uprightness feareth the LORD: but ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["he that is "]},"perverse in his ways despiseth him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:2"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PRO 14:3"},"In the mouth of the foolish is a rod of pride: but the lips of the wise shall preserve them. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:3"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PRO 14:4"},"Where no oxen ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are,"]}," the crib ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," clean: but much increase ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," by the strength of the ox. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:4"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PRO 14:5"},"A faithful witness will not lie: but a false witness will utter lies. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:5"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PRO 14:6"},"A scorner seeketh wisdom, and ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["findeth it"]}," not: but knowledge ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," easy unto him that understandeth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:6"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PRO 14:7"},"Go from the presence of a foolish man, when thou perceivest not ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["in him"]}," the lips of knowledge. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:7"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PRO 14:8"},"The wisdom of the prudent ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," to understand his way: but the folly of fools ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," deceit. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:8"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PRO 14:9"},"Fools make a mock at sin: but among the righteous ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is "]},"favour. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:9"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PRO 14:10"},"The heart knoweth his own bitterness; and a stranger doth not intermeddle with his joy. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:10"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PRO 14:11"},"The house of the wicked shall be overthrown: but the tabernacle of the upright shall flourish. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:11"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PRO 14:12"},"There is a way which seemeth right unto a man, but the end thereof ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," the ways of death. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:12"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PRO 14:13"},"Even in laughter the heart is sorrowful; and the end of that mirth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," heaviness. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:13"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PRO 14:14"},"The backslider in heart shall be filled with his own ways: and a good man ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["shall be satisfied"]}," from himself. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:14"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PRO 14:15"},"The simple believeth every word: but the prudent ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man"]}," looketh well to his going. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:15"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PRO 14:16"},"A wise ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man"]}," feareth, and departeth from evil: but the fool rageth, and is confident. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:16"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PRO 14:17"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["He that is"]}," soon angry dealeth foolishly: and a man of wicked devices is hated. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:17"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PRO 14:18"},"The simple inherit folly: but the prudent are crowned with knowledge. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:18"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PRO 14:19"},"The evil bow before the good; and the wicked at the gates of the righteous. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:19"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PRO 14:20"},"The poor is hated even of his own neighbour: but the rich ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["hath "]},"many friends. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:20"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PRO 14:21"},"He that despiseth his neighbour sinneth: but he that hath mercy on the poor, happy ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," he. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:21"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PRO 14:22"},"Do they not err that devise evil? but mercy and truth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["shall be "]},"to them that devise good. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:22"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PRO 14:23"},"In all labour there is profit: but the talk of the lips ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["tendeth "]},"only to penury. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:23"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"PRO 14:24"},"The crown of the wise is their riches: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["but"]}," the foolishness of fools ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," folly. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:24"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"25","sid":"PRO 14:25"},"A true witness delivereth souls: but a deceitful ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["witness "]},"speaketh lies. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:25"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"26","sid":"PRO 14:26"},"In the fear of the LORD ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," strong confidence: and his children shall have a place of refuge. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:26"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"27","sid":"PRO 14:27"},"The fear of the LORD ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," a fountain of life, to depart from the snares of death. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:27"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"28","sid":"PRO 14:28"},"In the multitude of people ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," the king’s honour: but in the want of people ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," the destruction of the prince. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:28"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"29","sid":"PRO 14:29"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["He that is"]}," slow to wrath ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," of great understanding: but ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["he that is"]}," hasty of spirit exalteth folly. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:29"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"30","sid":"PRO 14:30"},"A sound heart ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," the life of the flesh: but envy the rottenness of the bones. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:30"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"31","sid":"PRO 14:31"},"He that oppresseth the poor reproacheth his Maker: but he that honoureth him hath mercy on the poor. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:31"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"32","sid":"PRO 14:32"},"The wicked is driven away in his wickedness: but the righteous hath hope in his death. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:32"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"33","sid":"PRO 14:33"},"Wisdom resteth in the heart of him that hath understanding: but ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that which is"]}," in the midst of fools is made known. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:33"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"34","sid":"PRO 14:34"},"Righteousness exalteth a nation: but sin ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," a reproach to any people. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:34"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"35","sid":"PRO 14:35"},"The king’s favour ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," toward a wise servant: but his wrath is ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["against"]}," him that causeth shame. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 14:35"}]}]}
